## **Performance**

Typical workflow execution times (using Mistral):

| Stage | Time | Notes |
|-------|------|-------|
| Researcher | 10-15s | LLM inference |
| Writer (initial) | 15-20s | LLM inference |
| Reviewer | 10-15s | LLM inference |
| Coordinator | 2-5s | I/O only |
| **Total (no revision)** | **40-55s** | Single pass |
| **Total (1 revision)** | **65-90s** | Writer + Reviewer again |

**Factors affecting speed:**
- Model size (mistral is fast, llama2 is slower)
- GPU availability (CPU-only is slower)
- Topic complexity
- System load

